==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Burning Shadows|Tynamo|44}} from the {{TCG|Burning Shadows}} expansion.
*'''Tiny Charge''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Tynamo|57}} from the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Scarlet}}.

